!! Restart rules

|!Change |!Needs |
|JS modules (`click-outside.js`, `ring-layer.js`, `date-operators.js`, `check.js`, `actions.js`, `live-filter.js`, `live-widget.js`, `datalist.js` (startup: `list=` on field inputs), …) |Server restart, then reload |
|Areas, groups, actions, recipes, info parts, config |Nothing for the definitions; saving in edit mode refreshes the dock (outside edit mode run ↻) |
|`styles.tid`, `engine.tid`, `edit-engine.tid`, `dock.tid`, `panel.tid`, forms, recipe forms |Reload (they are normal tiddlers) |

!! Tests

```
bin/tw test work-focus          # Jasmine: dates, check, actions, run, ring geometry
bin/tw test:e2e work-focus      # Playwright: dock, panel, drag, ring, mutes
```

!! Adding a recipe, group or action

# Create a tiddler with the right tag (see //Reference//). Use the same title as a shipped one to override it.
# Reload. The next drag shows it. Nothing else to register.

!! Edit mode

* A bridge ships `<recipe title>/form` to give its recipe a form; no JS, no restart.
* Use `wf.tagged`, `wf.actions-all`, `wf.groups-all`, `wf.recipes-all` for tag lists: they leave out the form buffer.
* The Playwright specs for edit mode clean up the config tiddlers they create (`areas/`, `actions/`, `groups/`) and the edit state.

!! Debugging

* The snapshot tiddler shows what the last check saw; `errors` names a broken area filter.
* A drag that opens no ring means no action matched the item: check the action's `wf.filter` and that `wf.group` is set.
* `bin/tw test work-focus` runs the check and the actions without a browser.

